WEBVTT

00:07:26.465 --> 00:07:31.431
podium ya programu, iliyoachiliwa
na kampuni yangu, AutismSees,

00:07:31.455 --> 00:07:36.729
inauwezo wa kuchunguza kibinafsi
na kusaidia kuendeleza ujuzi wa mawasiliano.

00:07:37.324 --> 00:07:41.646
Zaidi ya hapo, inafuatilia
kutizama kwa macho kupitia kamera

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:47.577
na inaigiza mazungumzo ya halaiki
na uzoefu wa mahojiano ya kazi.

00:07:48.561 --> 00:07:51.118
Na hivyo labda siku moja,
Waffle House wanaweza kuniajiri,

00:07:51.142 --> 00:07:53.322
Baada ya kuifanyia mazoezi kwa muda.

00:07:53.346 --> 00:07:54.527
(kicheko)

00:07:57.162 --> 00:08:02.681
Na moja ya kitu kizuri zaidi
ni kuwa nimetumia Podium